# Synthetic examples only. Use a private HTTP client environment for credentials/tokens.
# Requests mutate the selected environment. Run individually; replace IDs and OTP deliberately.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@accountId = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
@mediaId = 66666666-6666-4666-8666-666666666666

### 1. Register Farmer (profile.fullName); Trader uses profile.businessName
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"example_farmer","email":"farmer@example.test","password":"{{password}}","role":"FARMER","profile":{"fullName":"Example Farmer"}}

### 2. Verify email using the code received by this identity
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"farmer@example.test","otp":"{{otp}}"}

### 3. Resend OTP (quota/cooldown apply)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"farmer@example.test"}

### 4. Login; store returned tokens privately, never in this file
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"example_farmer","password":"{{password}}"}

### 5. Refresh rotates the token; previous refresh becomes invalid
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"{{refreshToken}}"}

### 6. Logout this refresh session (bearer must belong to its owner)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"{{refreshToken}}"}

### 7. Private profile; ADMIN profile=null
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Full PUT for Farmer; omitted optional fields become null; avatar must be owned
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName":"Example Farmer","province":"Example Province","district":"Example District"}

### 9. Public account profile (six whitelisted fields; target/caller must be ACTIVE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. Public Farmer profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/farmers/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 11. Public Trader profile (use a Trader accountId)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/traders/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 12. Admin creates FARMER/TRADER UNVERIFIED; no API creates ADMIN
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"example_trader","email":"trader@example.test","password":"{{password}}","role":"TRADER","profile":{"businessName":"Example Trader"}}

### 13. Admin paginated list (page=0, size=20, maximum=100)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/accounts?page=0&size=20&role=FARMER&status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### 14. Admin account details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### 15. Admin profile PATCH allowlist; no role/email/password/status/reputation edits
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName":"Updated Farmer"}

### 16. Admin status; ACTIVE restore still requires verified/score/lock guards
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/accounts/{{accountId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"LOCKED","reason":"MANUAL_REVIEW"}

### 17. Soft-delete -> INACTIVE; refresh revoked
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### 18. Avatar upload. Define avatarFile as a private absolute path to JPEG/PNG/WebP <=5MiB
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=AvatarExampleBoundary

--AvatarExampleBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="avatar.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< {{avatarFile}}
--AvatarExampleBoundary--

### 19. Avatar owner/current-public access; ADMIN media is owner-only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/media/{{mediaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 20. Internal caller ONLY; Gateway must never route this path publicly
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}/access-state
X-Service-Key: {{gatewayServiceKey}}

### Operational probes (not included in the 20 business/internal endpoints)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health/readiness

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health/liveness
